    "index:01acab69-cdbe-492c-a70f-e4dc5fb36658:text": {
      "original": "\n            <p>To help save you time, some features are set up in this template, like:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Translations powered by <a href=\"https://rosey.cc/\">Rosey</a> and the Rosey CloudCannon Connector</li>\n<li>A split-by-directory blog, with a whole content file per language</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://cloudcannon.com/documentation/articles/introduction-to-editable-regions/\">Editable regions</a></li>\n<li>Blog with pagination, tags and <a href=\"https://cloudcannon.com/documentation/articles/snippets-using-eleventy-shortcodes/\">snippets</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.11ty.dev/docs/plugins/image/\">Image optimization</a></li>\n<li>SEO Controls</li>\n<li>Responsive header and footer</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fontawesome.com/search?o=r&amp;m=free&amp;s=solid\">Font Awesome Icons</a></li>\n<li>Schemas for adding new pages</li>\n<li>Editable color pallete</li>\n<li>Markdown styles</li>\n<li>CloudCannon configuration</li>\n</ul>\n\n          ",
      "value": null,
      "pages": {
        "index.html": 1
      },
      "total": 1
    },
