    "index:8b6c6715-bec1-4872-a9cd-0f56b06d301e:subheading": {
      "original": "\n        <p>A starting point for <strong>developers building a multilingual website with Eleventy, Rosey and CloudCannon</strong>. Translate this page from the Visual Editor, or edit the locale files directly — both round-trip to the same place.</p>\n\n      ",
