    "index:f8d20580-8173-4f97-bb2b-ad6729854cb6:text": {
      "original": "\n            <p>CloudCannon is a flexible Git-backed CMS that specialises in editing markdown and data files.</p>\n<p>Visual editing allows you to preview your changes live before you save them.</p>\n<p>Git-backed means you can keep all your familiar git workflows, while providing an easy-to-understand interface for non-technical editors to collaborate via Git.</p>\n\n          ",
      "value": null,
